# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. The binding refusal tells an unknown origin
# apart from a mismatch, which lets a caller enumerate the configured peers.
MODULE: ReceiverBindingRefusalNamesCause
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an origin with no configured secret draws a distinguishable refusal

--- FIND
    ELSE IF binding /\ ~Bound(hdr, cred) THEN "unbound"
--- REPLACE
    ELSE IF binding /\ ~Bound(hdr, cred) THEN (IF hdr # NoHeader /\ Secret(hdr) = NoSecret THEN "unknownOrigin" ELSE "unbound")
--- END